              <rect class="fig-c1" x="256" y="115" width="40" height="55"><title>旧機械の売却損による節税 110×0.3＝33万円</title></rect>
              <text class="fig-val" x="276" y="109" text-anchor="middle">＋33</text>
              <text class="fig-tick" x="276" y="248" text-anchor="middle">売却損節税</text>
              <path class="fig-c2" d="M316,230V119Q316,115 320,115H352Q356,115 356,119V230Z"><title>初年度 69万円</title></path>
              <text class="fig-val" x="336" y="109" text-anchor="middle">69</text>
              <text class="fig-tick" x="336" y="248" text-anchor="middle">初年度</text>
